@startuml sequence_01_pendaftaran
title Sequence Diagram - Pendaftaran Magang

actor "Peserta\n(Mahasiswa/Siswa)" as Peserta
boundary "Halaman Web" as UI
control "SiswaController" as Ctrl
entity "Database" as DB
actor Admin as Admin

Peserta -> UI : Isi formulir pendaftaran & Upload berkas
UI -> Ctrl : POST /siswa/apply
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> DB : Simpan data aplikasi (status='pending')
activate DB
DB --> Ctrl : Response success
deactivate DB
Ctrl --> UI : Redirect & Tampilkan notifikasi "Pending"
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> Peserta : Tampilan Dashboard Pending

== Verifikasi oleh Admin ==
Admin -> UI : Lihat daftar lamaran masuk
UI -> Ctrl : GET /application
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> DB : Ambil data lamaran 'pending'
activate DB
DB --> Ctrl : Data lamaran
deactivate DB
Ctrl --> UI : Tampilkan tabel lamaran
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Admin : Tabel data lamaran

Admin -> UI : Klik "Terima" & tetapkan divisi/pembimbing
UI -> Ctrl : POST /application/accept
activate Ctrl
Ctrl -> DB : Update status='accepted', set pembimbing
activate DB
DB --> Ctrl : Success
deactivate DB
Ctrl -> Ctrl : Generate Surat Balasan Penerimaan\nKirim Notifikasi Email
Ctrl --> UI : Redirect & success message
deactivate Ctrl
UI --> Admin : Notifikasi berhasil

@enduml
